  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/h0bSBTU.png\" alt=\"长椅横幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"951\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Benched（长椅）</strong>模组添加了独特的<strong>野餐长椅</strong>！</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">野餐长椅的尺寸为2x2，只需右键点击即可坐下！你也可以在长椅上放置物品！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/o557rZJ.png\" alt=\"金合欢木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;金合欢木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/s3DdOvG.png\" alt=\"金合欢木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4cA25LP.png\" alt=\"白桦木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;白桦木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bSC2YjD.png\" alt=\"白桦木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kNCPjEM.png\" alt=\"深色橡木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;深色橡木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zP1KfN1.png\" alt=\"深色橡木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hpNnXpB.png\" alt=\"丛林木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;丛林木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/dkZGlNO.png\" alt=\"丛林木野餐长椅\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Z8nD3UF.png\" alt=\"橡木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;橡木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CS2Tf4o.png\" alt=\"野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lR5h4bF.png\" alt=\"云杉木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;云杉木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NeOEwLN.png\" alt=\"云杉木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"187\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TccrptN.png\" alt=\"绯红木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> 绯红木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0d6gr6F.png\" alt=\"绯红木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Q3GdQ67.png\" alt=\"诡异木野餐长椅\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">&nbsp;诡异木野餐长椅</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/avY6zJX.png\" alt=\"诡异木野餐长椅合成表\" width=\"350\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/6Ygx045.png\" alt=\"Benched 图片\" width=\"711\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>常见问题解答 (FAQ)</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></h4>\n<h5>当然可以，欢迎在你的整合包中使用我的模组。</h5>\n<h4><strong>你可以坐在长椅上吗？</strong></h4>\n<h5>是的，只需右键点击长椅即可坐下。</h5>\n<h4><strong>你可以在长椅上放置物品吗？</strong></h4>\n<h5>是的，手持物品右键点击长椅即可在其上放置物品。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Discord 社区</strong></h3>\n<h5>如需获取后续内容、即将推出的模组信息以及参与讨论，欢迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 服务器！</h5>\n<h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png\" alt=\"Benched 分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://imgur.com/bA5x3eg.png\" alt=\"野餐长椅\" width=\"266\" height=\"266\">&nbsp;</p>",
